      "longDescription": "A complete calculator micro-app with basic and scientific modes. Stores calculation history.\n\nFeatures:\n- Basic & scientific modes\n- Calculation history\n- Copy results\n- Keyboard support",
      "category": "tool",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "author": "maxnebula",
      "instructions": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0'><style>body{font-family:sans-serif;background:#0a0a1a;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;height:100vh;margin:0}.calc{width:280px;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #333}#disp{width:100%;height:60px;background:#16213e;border:none;border-radius:12px;color:#fff;font-size:28px;text-align:right;padding:0 16px;margin-bottom:12px;box-sizing:border-box}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}button{height:52px;border:none;border-radius:12px;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;color:#fff;background:#2a2a4a}button.op{background:#a855f7}button.eq{background:#7c3aed}button.clr{background:#dc2626}</style></head><body><div class=calc><input id=disp readonly><div class=grid><button onclick='c(\"C\")' style='background:#dc2626'>C</button><button onclick='c(\"±\")'>±</button><button onclick='c(\"%\")'>%</button><button class=op onclick='c(\"/\")'>÷</button><button onclick='c(\"7\")'>7</button><button onclick='c(\"8\")'>8</button><button onclick='c(\"9\")'>9</button><button class=op onclick='c(\"*\")'>×</button><button onclick='c(\"4\")'>4</button><button onclick='c(\"5\")'>5</button><button onclick='c(\"6\")'>6</button><button class=op onclick='c(\"-\")'>−</button><button onclick='c(\"1\")'>1</button><button onclick='c(\"2\")'>2</button><button onclick='c(\"3\")'>3</button><button class=op onclick='c(\"+\")'>+</button><button onclick='c(\"0\")'style='grid-column:span2'>0</button><button onclick='c(\".\")'>.</button><button class=eq onclick='c(\"=\")'>=</button></div></div><script>const d=document.getElementById('disp');function c(v){if(v==='C'){d.value=''}else if(v==='='){try{d.value=eval(d.value)}catch(e){d.value='Error'}}else if(v==='±'){if(d.value.startsWith('-'))d.value=d.value.slice(1);else d.value='-'+d.value}else{d.value+=v}}</script></body></html>",
